{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から学校ですた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もリハありました。\nんー明日楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとっては初全国握手会なので...\nあああぁぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よみうりランドの握手会参加したかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加できなかった分名古屋、大阪頑張るっっっ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、名古屋のみなさん待っててください‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういやれいかがなんか私のこと書いてたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかというかっっ\nれいかのために\nれいかに愛を込めて描いたやつ‼\n載せられないなんて...‼オーノー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでやっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさん載せてくれないかなー(ハート)⁇\nとか言ってたから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーうしょっがないなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかのために載せるよ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だだーん‼電車の中で描いた。\nだってねだってね、\n「いっつも写真の落書きどうやってるの？\n私にも書いてよぉ」\nてれかたんが言うからー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これプラス最近撮ったれいかの寝顔\nだいぶ前に撮ったはしゃぎすぎ\nれいかとまりかを送りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかのブログに載ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝顔美しすぎて見惚れてたのは\nここだけのひみつね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだ絡んだられいかうれしそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にやにやにやにや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このっツンデレイカ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかだいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんどくさいところもすきだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度れいかと一緒に写真撮ろっと:D♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/8510663/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}